                    "value": "DATA FOUNDATION\n\nSOURCE\nWorld Bank Open Data; underlying health indicators are attributed to WHO.\n\nANALYTICAL WINDOW\n2000–2023 common period. 4,529 complete country-year observations across 192 countries; the 2023 snapshot contains 191 countries.\n\nGRAIN\nCountry × year. Missing indicator-years are excluded. Country averages are not population weighted.\n\nREPRODUCIBILITY\nThe PBIP includes the prepared CSV, Power Query import, semantic model, DAX measures, report definition, and source documentation.",
